    (scrolling tok/s + request sparklines), the token-exhaust snake, request
    swimlanes (queue→prefill→decode, from average per-stage vLLM latencies),
    a live stats panel (throughput/cache/latency/container), and a TT silicon
    strip correlating serving activity with real per-chip power/temp/AICLK.
    Regions collapse gracefully on smaller terminals.
  * vLLM /metrics parsing extended: per-stage latency, inter-token time,
    prefix-cache hit rate, preemptions.
  * Loading sequence reskinned with ANSI-art shading: block-ramp gradients and
    a compile→load→ready teal→gold hue sweep with a bright leading edge.

