tt-toplike (0.7.8) noble; urgency=medium

  * The [i] Inference Server Monitor is now one unified "snake" across all
    three states, replacing the Down-roster list:
    - cold  → a hungry snake roams the model-catalog starfield;
    - loading → the snake grows through the compile→load journey (gold burst
      at ready);
    - serving → a calm living creature whose form encodes live vLLM signals
      directly (body length = in-flight requests, wave = tokens/s, colour =
      KV-cache load, a pulse per completed request, a fray on errors), with a
      stats line: tok/s · running · queued · KV% · TTFT · served. Near-still
      when idle.
  * New: scrape the vLLM Prometheus /metrics endpoint per tick and fold live
    ServingStats (rates from counter deltas) onto each inference service.

