tt-toplike (0.7.5) noble; urgency=medium

  * Inference Server Monitor [i] view is now a tri-state surface:
    - cold trail (nothing running) shows a model-catalog starfield
      screensaver: the Tenstorrent compatibility catalog as drifting stars,
      with models that run on the detected hardware lit up ("N of M models
      run on your <arch>"). Bundled snapshot + background curl refresh.
    - a compiling/loading service takes over full-screen with a boxed-snake
      progress visualization (compile -> load -> ready), filling by true %
      when a baseline exists else by live kernel/RSS momentum, and turning
      red when a load stalls (Alarm).
    - otherwise the live service list, as before.
  * Process list: outside --host mode, only processes contributing to TT
    hardware load are shown; `i` opens the Inference Server Monitor.
  * Defrag EVICT now fires on model unload / after a load surge.
  * New dependency (Recommends): curl, for the catalog refresh (HTTPS).

