tt-toplike (0.6.3) noble; urgency=medium

  * Add HostBackend (--host / --backend host): run all visualisations on
    any machine without Tenstorrent hardware. Reads CPU frequency, package
    temperature (hwmon coretemp/k10temp), and RAM usage via sysinfo + Linux
    sysfs RAPL. Maps to same Telemetry fields so Starfield, Memory Flow,
    Memory Castle, and Arcade all work unchanged.
  * Fix: default tt-toplike binary (from cargo install) now delegates to
    tt-toplike-tui instead of printing a deprecation message. Users can
    run `tt-toplike` directly after cargo install.
  * Fix: /legend, /help, /explain overlays (and l/? hotkeys) in TUI
  * Fix: Memory Flow now visualises all devices simultaneously (multi-device
    hue-band assignment; per-device particle budget).
  * docs: HOST_BACKEND.md; README "Try it on any machine" section.

