tt-toplike (0.6.2) noble; urgency=medium

  * Fix power reporting: HybridBackend now overlays SMBUS TDP/TDC onto sysfs
    telemetry so displayed wattage covers all power domains (Tensix + GDDR),
    matching tt-smi output. Previously the hwmon driver's vcore-only reading
    was used, which could be ~50% lower than firmware-reported total board power
    on newer firmware versions (e.g. 19.10.0).

