tt-toplike (0.6.1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Fix static-width number formatting: all telemetry values in arcade, TUI
    footer, memory castle, and memory flow stats bars now use minimum-width
    format specifiers (e.g. {:5.1}) so the string length never changes as
    values cross digit boundaries, eliminating layout jitter.
  * Insights compact mode: when all device panels would not fit side-by-side
    at full width (stats_w=31, gap=1), automatically switch to compact layout
    (stats_w=19, gap=0). Four Blackhole cards now fit in 151 columns instead
    of 203. Portrait art is never scaled; only the stats sidebar shrinks.
    Compact sidebar shows power bar+value, ETH count, ASIC temp, and FW
    version; GDDR temps and fan RPM are omitted in compact mode only.

