tt-toplike (0.5.0) noble; urgency=medium

  * Fix arcade separator borders: use unicode-width display columns instead of
    byte length so emoji labels (🏰, 🌊, ✧) don't truncate the ─ run on each
    side; odd remainders distributed right so total always fills terminal width.
  * Fix starfield centering: span-based formula (grid_rows-1)*spacing ensures
    the dot grid is centered on its geometric midpoint in all panel sizes,
    including small arcade panels where height < grid_rows.
  * Fix arcade topology: board brackets [ ] now wrap the whole board including
    the ←→ intra-board link, making multi-chip carrier boards read as
    contained units separated by ═══.
  * Add --mock N shorthand: --mock 32 now equivalent to --mock --mock-devices 32.

